# Cross-origin isolation, required so the multithreaded ffmpeg.wasm engine
# can use SharedArrayBuffer. Understood by Netlify and Cloudflare Pages.
# If you deploy elsewhere (Vercel, custom server, etc.), set the same two
# headers on every response at the host/server level instead.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
